{
"file": 409,
"paths": [
"d008/d014/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "eeea2d35",
"en_raw": "Ah!"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "28327a03",
"en_raw": "Nao, look, look!"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "ff6af5f9",
"en_raw": "Hi-'Ru'-mi...?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "225cfcf0",
"en_raw": "Why would the character 'ru'"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "e1f8c233",
"en_raw": "be in there..."
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "c9926ff9",
"en_raw": "The middle character is the same as Kurumi's!"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "803b69f2",
"en_raw": "Hey hey Nao"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "adbaeaa2",
"en_raw": "What does this character mean?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "3cf091e7",
"en_raw": "It means to stay"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "f297a8e4",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "5acd328d",
"en_raw": "...I wonder if she understands"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "584cf66e",
"en_raw": "for real"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "2aa9145a",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "1f139824",
"en_raw": "Why in the middle?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "d32e9a06",
"en_raw": "Isn't it something like"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "fd42a817",
"en_raw": "a pillow word?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "c752724e",
"en_raw": "Is that true..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "55b499f9",
"en_raw": "Oh my, you don't know?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "ba9960c4",
"en_raw": "Hirumi was originally"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "d3ac32cf",
"en_raw": "written like that"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "3a3cc39a",
"en_raw": "Um, excuse me"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "6e8a5fe0",
"en_raw": "What is it?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "8128c697",
"en_raw": "...Originally it was that name?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "35301a0d",
"en_raw": "To see the evening sun stay..."
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "7ac31697",
"en_raw": "That's why it's written Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "8f60f45c",
"en_raw": "It's a beautiful name, isn't it"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "08c6274f",
"en_raw": "The 'ru'~ in Kurumi is"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "17140818",
"en_raw": "this same character!"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "a4cd7ff8",
"en_raw": "Your name is Kurumi?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "82e1f995",
"en_raw": "What an unusual name"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "07872856",
"en_raw": "Beauty that stays long..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "af499054",
"en_raw": "It's a good name"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "8c30e16d",
"en_raw": "It suits you"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "767b0f2f",
"en_raw": "I used to like"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "1747e494",
"en_raw": "I used to like it, but..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "93386ac0",
"en_raw": "You seem to have lived"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "dd12a519",
"en_raw": "in Hirumi a long time..."
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "f277ae97",
"en_raw": "Well, since before"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "ac0399d7",
"en_raw": "your mother was born"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "0a1b4276",
"en_raw": "I've been living here"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "c159222f",
"en_raw": "Then, um..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "1bb16f65",
"en_raw": "Have you heard there's a grave"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "98e5bc54",
"en_raw": "around here?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "4abf747d",
"en_raw": "A grave? Let me think..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "6b4b4445",
"en_raw": "Oh, the bus is here"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "7660e693",
"en_raw": "Well then"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "a6bdd9f4",
"en_raw": "Hey, look, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "d6f97182",
"en_raw": "Amazing, Sango-chan"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "dab90ce6",
"en_raw": "...It's just a heron"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "5893a48e",
"en_raw": "That old woman"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "359e6779",
"en_raw": "isn't coming today?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "d7bb1e9d",
"en_raw": "Shall we wait a little?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "8df08bda",
"en_raw": "Wait / Don't  ...Whether we'd meet her or not"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "324cd557",
"en_raw": "isn't certain..."
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "c61afc04",
"en_raw": "...If we wait a bit"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "245d01e5",
"en_raw": "she might come..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "057a9e8c",
"en_raw": "Maybe she's already gone"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "2ca5854e",
"en_raw": "Looks like we came too late"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "ebe125c9",
"en_raw": "Well, well, we meet again"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "4af33eb1",
"en_raw": "Um, I want to ask"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "a5975641",
"en_raw": "about the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "a19189e7",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "c3e5e336",
"en_raw": "I'd like to ask something"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "368ea33c",
"en_raw": "Graves are"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "c7731084",
"en_raw": "at temples, aren't they?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "b736a96a",
"en_raw": "Oh, no, not that"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "a3c77f62",
"en_raw": "Hanako-san's..."
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "bce00aa1",
"en_raw": "Who-ko-san?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "8ab31760",
"en_raw": "Um, oh, never mind"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "172143a8",
"en_raw": "I don't understand at all"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "a19189e7",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "6844e948",
"en_raw": "It's a little girl's grave"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "b4e644db",
"en_raw": "Um, not an ordinary girl..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "f0ba918f",
"en_raw": "Well, then"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "107c777d",
"en_raw": "that's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "fb3c0adb",
"en_raw": "...Hime, no, Mori?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "fa4c6424",
"en_raw": "Go along the hospital road"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "d80745f1",
"en_raw": "and turn toward the river"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "82c7e1f2",
"en_raw": "it's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "85f40324",
"en_raw": "What's the Hime Grove?"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "8225b59d",
"en_raw": "Long ago, before I was born"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "89ba361c",
"en_raw": "a very, very old story"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "33ed6f12",
"en_raw": "You see, this river"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "452af943",
"en_raw": "now has a fine bridge"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "8c18a01d",
"en_raw": "...A monorail?"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "9403fb69",
"en_raw": "They even say they'll run"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "95ac8a98",
"en_raw": "such a thing, but"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "893231eb",
"en_raw": "Long, long ago"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "536b5c0e",
"en_raw": "it often flooded, apparently"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "b8eda5f9",
"en_raw": "You understand?"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "f87125cc",
"en_raw": "When it rained"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "f6f41b9a",
"en_raw": "the river water washed away fields and houses"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "678699ce",
"en_raw": "So they built"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "6dbc377f",
"en_raw": "reinforcements around the river"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "2bb5161d",
"en_raw": "but it didn't go well"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "548ea64c",
"en_raw": "and in the end, every year"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "dfd33f76",
"en_raw": "the water overflowed"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "74c6ff20",
"en_raw": "...I see"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "55d2da63",
"en_raw": "The Hime Grove is"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "38f6b8ec",
"en_raw": "a shrine enshrining"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "494e9b1f",
"en_raw": "a little girl"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "a2ed453d",
"en_raw": "It's a story I often heard"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "97c70c0c",
"en_raw": "as a child"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "540767a6",
"en_raw": "It's a frightening"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "62aad48e",
"en_raw": "and sad story"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "f1ddac9b",
"en_raw": "It's also known as"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "57549993",
"en_raw": "human sacrifice"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "aff32d3d",
"en_raw": "To calm the river"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "08da13b8",
"en_raw": "along with various offerings"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "cc1052d5",
"en_raw": "one small, lovely girl"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "e419cf3f",
"en_raw": "to the bottom of the water..."
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "a371aafc",
"en_raw": "People of old did terrible things"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "cb887e6f",
"en_raw": "But strangely, since then"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "7e33c714",
"en_raw": "the river never flooded, they say"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "560b5b6e",
"en_raw": "So out of gratitude to the girl"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "a457620f",
"en_raw": "they built a shrine"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "3497a36b",
"en_raw": "That's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "aefd81b8",
"en_raw": "Um, so then"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "52897418",
"en_raw": "...what was the girl's name?"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "d1646675",
"en_raw": "Well, I don't know that far"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "44211551",
"en_raw": "Um, could you tell me"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "8ee73e19",
"en_raw": "the location once more?"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "bf291428",
"en_raw": "Yes, of course"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "9db6536b",
"en_raw": "Go in on the street"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "78a40981",
"en_raw": "with the big hospital, before it"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "5ded7fbc",
"en_raw": "and turn toward the river at that crossroads"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "82c7e1f2",
"en_raw": "it's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "0a7e347e",
"en_raw": "Is that all you want to ask?"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "eaa183e6",
"en_raw": "Ah, yes."
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "e333a75e",
"en_raw": "Thank you very much"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "7660e693",
"en_raw": "Well then"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "ed99d5d3",
"en_raw": "I don't know the road ahead..."
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "b5bb2ada",
"en_raw": "For a walk, this is"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "e7d20466",
"en_raw": "a bit too far"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "c0e859da",
"en_raw": "If we go somewhere unfamiliar"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "c1f8d9b5",
"en_raw": "we won't be able to get home"
}
]
}